  "priorExpiration": "2007-04-07",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 701.12 Purpose of a Reconsideration. The purpose of a reconsideration of a founded determination for a non-registry eligible perpetrator or victim of self-neglect shall be for the bureau administrator to consider new or additional information, or the accuracy of the information obtained during the investigation, or both.\n\nSource. #5008, eff 11-27-90, EXPIRED: 11-27-96\n\nNew. #6867, eff 10-9-98; ss by #8727, INTERIM, eff 10-9-06, EXPIRED: 4-7-07\n\nNew. #8868, eff 4-19-07; (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for He-E 700) #10179, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13600, eff 3-24-23 (formerly He-E 701.13)",
